;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=898, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=25, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=471, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1505, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1395, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> went to the restroom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> did that on purpose, didn't you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you mean?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="2"> talked and acted like that on purpose so </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would go to the restroom, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Normally you don't press things that hard when you talk."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Whoops... you caught on, huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So, what was the point?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"With <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> here, it'd be hard to talk about what comes next."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You were going to say something even nastier?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"To talk about this case, you can't leave out the past Megasawa City case."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's nasty about the Megasawa City case?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The way they were killed."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The way they were killed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Yes, in what state the victims of the Megasawa City case were killed. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's not something I can say in front of <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I get it. I know about that too. I remember all of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Or rather, do you have to go that far to talk about it? I'm only asking out of curiosity, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> asked <STYLE ID="2">'How were they killed in the Megasawa City case?'</STYLE>, what should I do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I get it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
'I can't say it in front of <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.'<STYLE ID="2"> If </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> said something like that, it'd make </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> feel she had to be considerate."</STYLE><PG>
"If I'd known <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> knew, I wouldn't have needed to do this, though."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But, is the way they were killed that important?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's important. This case has a lot in common with the Megasawa City case. 
{PAUSE ""}
The real problem is why such a horrible way of killing was necessary."<PG>
"Think about it. 
{PAUSE ""}
The victims of the first Megasawa City case were two second graders. 
{PAUSE ""}
One had the torso cut through with a large blade; the other's neck was taken in a single stroke. 
{PAUSE ""}
In the second Megasawa City case, one had every tooth smashed and was then stabbed to death with a knife, and what's more, most of the stabs missed the vital spots. 
{PAUSE ""}
The other's arms and legs were crushed with a mace, and once immobilized, had a toxic chemical forced into the mouth, and died. 
{PAUSE ""}
The third time―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The third time, the arms and legs were cut off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And every bone in the body shattered, the belly slit open, and left alive on the mountain, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Every one of them is horrible..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. Doesn't it bother you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"With each round, the killings have gotten more elaborate. 
{PAUSE ""}
And they're set up so the victims don't die right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I get that, but... what do you mean it bothers you?"</STYLE><PG>
"Killing like this must take a lot of effort. 
{PAUSE ""}
The risk is far too great for it to be done just as a thrill killing. 
{PAUSE ""}
And the crowning example is this case. 
{PAUSE ""}
For the culprit, you could say both the effort and the risk were the greatest yet."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So the question is what all that elaborate killing was for?"</STYLE><PG>
"Exactly. If you think of it as the culprit's taste, a lot of things don't sit right."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh-huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So, if </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2">'re bringing this up, that means you've reached some conclusion?"</STYLE><PG>
"It's only a hypothesis, though. 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
The culprit probably didn't want to kill."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I mean the culprit didn't want to cause another incident, not one more. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, I think it might have been a warning: the next target will die an even worse death. 
{PAUSE ""}
I thought it was very likely a message saying: don't make me kill anymore."<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's pretty crazy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, it's crazy. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, I think we can assume the culprit was cornered to the point of having to kill."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, but still―"</STYLE><PG>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s coming back. Let's leave it at that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------